# Commands

```bash
npm ci
npm run build
npm test
npm run validate
npm run benchmark:social
npm run qa:social
npm run qa:next-week
npm run console:check
```

CI runs build, test, validate, and console:check with no secrets. `.cursor/environment.json` installs with `npm ci` and starts no long-running service. Founder Console preview is localhost-only (`npm run console:dev`).
